  "metaDescription": "Order custom plastic coffee tea cocoa cups with your logo. Perfect for events, offices, and giveaways. Get a quote at Perfect Imprints.",
  "introHtml": "<p>Plastic coffee, tea, and cocoa cups offer a durable, lightweight alternative to ceramic or glass, making them ideal for outdoor events, corporate giveaways, and high-traffic break rooms. Unlike single-use paper, these reusable plastic mugs and tumblers can be imprinted with your logo using screen printing or pad printing for long-lasting brand visibility. Options like the 16 oz Roadster Mug or 26 oz Tumbler provide insulation for hot drinks while remaining shatter-resistant. Choose plastic for a cost-effective way to keep your brand in hand.</p>",
